{"id": "86330", "name": "אי-שוויון עם ערך מוחלט – |2x − n| < n (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Solve the following inequality: \\[ {{CT:0}} &lt; {{CT:1}}.\\] <br /> Write your answer as a logical sequence of inequalities, such as \\( x&gt;=5\\) and/or \\(x&lt; 13\\). <br /> <br /> [[input:ans1]]  [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>As \\[|2{{CT:2}}| &lt; {{CT:1}}.\\]</p>\n<p>Then \\[2{{CT:2}} &lt; {{CT:1}} \\mbox{   and   } 2{{CT:2}} &gt; -{{CT:1}}.\\]</p>\n<p>Hence \\[2{{CT:3}} &lt; {{CT:1}} + {{CT:1}} \\mbox{   and   } 2{{CT:3}} &gt; -{{CT:1}}+{{CT:1}}.\\]</p>\n<p>\\[2{{CT:3}} &lt; {{CT:4}} \\mbox{   and   } 2{{CT:3}} &gt; {{CT:5}}.\\]</p>\n<p>\\[{{CT:3}} &lt; {{CT:1}} \\mbox{   and   } {{CT:3}} &gt; 0.\\]</p>\n<p>This can be entered as \\({{CT:3}}&gt;0\\) and \\({{CT:3}}&lt;{{CT:1}}\\).</p>\n<p> </p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Resul